# Line endings (T051). Content, templates, and styles are stored with LF line endings so diffs stay
# line-by-line on GitHub. (Git can't normalize old Mac CR-only files; CI's "Check sources have no CR line
# endings" step catches those.) The Windows wrapper script keeps CRLF.
src/jbake/content/**    text eol=lf
src/jbake/templates/**  text eol=lf
src/scss/**             text eol=lf
*.bat                   text eol=crlf
